    "$t": "青春"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>曾小餘</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">青春是——</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一本m̄-thang</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">掀kah siunn緊ê冊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ài勻勻仔　看</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">恬恬仔　唱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">看伊搬一齣</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無結果ê愛情</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽in唱一段</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">哭調仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我講　來來來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán koh做伙　跳一段舞步</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Se̍h來se̍h去　se̍h到jiâu痕ná來ná深</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit本冊　就ná掀ná薄</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮講青春ê　鹹酸苦tsiánn</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">掀過了後tsiah知影</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjJOWht_c86Y1xaZXfC2Ncr0iZo1KXSQxScwlQLp0txUJqC4wjxBu-aLLvXm_RrS0glgqVbzGOaaDGdX32nEfOLfDqiJBM8seZY6ZtwaNxvjjpygc__ShzJHnOq2g6TLKz2bSWHUGrr3fqEFcsKlgE88X4wMFJmCkmraw5S8MHIQgXvm46OVKBegaC37XgP/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%8